---
// Accessibility statement: WCAG 2.1 AA is the target, not a claim of full conformance.
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Accessibility Statement | Regain Hope Detox and Recovery Center" description="Regain Hope Detox and Recovery Center's accessibility statement: our WCAG 2.1 AA target, known limitations, and how to report a barrier or ask for help.">
  <section class="minihero"><div class="container">
    <h1>Accessibility Statement</h1>
    <p>Last updated November 23, 2026</p>
  </div></section>
  <section><div class="container rich" style="max-width:820px;">
    <p>Regain Hope Detox and Recovery Center wants this website to be usable by as many people as possible, including people who use screen readers, screen magnifiers, voice control, or a keyboard instead of a mouse.</p>
    <h2>Our target</h2>
    <p>We use the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA, published by the World Wide Web Consortium (W3C), as the target for building and reviewing this site. Accessibility is ongoing work, and some content may not yet fully meet that standard.</p>
    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>A “Skip to content” link is the first stop for keyboard users on every page.</li>
      <li>Menus, links, buttons, and forms can be used with a keyboard.</li>
      <li>Form fields have visible labels, and errors are announced to screen readers.</li>
      <li>Phone numbers are links you can tap to call.</li>
      <li>Layouts adapt to phones, tablets, and desktops.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Known limitations</h2>
    <p>Some parts of this website rely on services we do not control, such as Google Maps and social media platforms. These may not fully meet WCAG 2.1 AA. Our address is also shown as text next to every map, and you can call us for any information you cannot reach.</p>
    <h2>Report a barrier or ask for help</h2>
    <p>If something on this website is hard to use, or you need information in another format, call us at <a href="tel:+18182644388">(818) 264-4388</a> or email <a href="mailto:info@regainhopedetox.com">info@regainhopedetox.com</a>. It helps to tell us the page address, what went wrong, and the browser or assistive technology you were using.</p>
    <p>This website is not a substitute for emergency care. In crisis, call or text <b>988</b> (Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline) or call <b>911</b>.</p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
